// Deciding whether a `#` begins a line marker, and entering one.

// 1 if only horizontal whitespace separates `i` from the start of its line.
// The backward walk is at_bol_next/at_bol_scan in store/append.id: a call may not
// be an argument to a call, and `j >= 0` guards a peek that would otherwise
// run off the front of the buffer, so neither step can be named in place.
at_bol(word base, int i) {
  int j = i - 1;
  int r = at_bol_next(base, j);
} return int r;
